{"ID":"20240118144959-3mvmpef","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144959-3mvmpef","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144959-3mvmpef\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144959-9jep0n8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165819-3aw1sy4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:455,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165819-3aw1sy4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:59,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:59\u0026#125;","title":"366补09柏叶（侧柏叶）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204161856"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144959-9jep0n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144959-9jep0n8","updated":"20240122165721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，山野最宜种植，树高大可作木材，叶侧生者入药，名侧柏叶。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165722-dcasbqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165722-dcasbqc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦涩，性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165724-8gc52l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165724-8gc52l6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】侧柏叶为滋阴凉血要药，主吐血衄血尿血便血，治冷鞥湿痹，傅汤火伤，生肌杀虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165725-2i9exuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165725-2i9exuo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主吐血，衄血，痢血，崩中赤白，益气，令人耐寒暑，去湿痹生肌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165727-8gcbjlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165727-8gcbjlv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治冷风历节疼痛，止尿血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165728-72dqeoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165728-72dqeoe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】灸罯冻疮，烧取汁涂头，黑润鬓发。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165730-ijmxmjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165730-ijmxmjv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】傅汤火伤，止痛减瘢，服之疗蛊痢，作汤常服杀五脏虫，益人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165731-18izo17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165731-18izo17"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165732-jcyrx5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165732-jcyrx5e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】畏菊花诸石，忌面，得酒良，焙干用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165739-wopqmn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165739-wopqmn9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"侧柏子壳——和鸡子清调服，解砒霜毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165740-e747lx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165740-e747lx0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"侧柏子枝节——治风痹，历节风，疗虫疥。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165742-b55buel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165742-b55buel","updated":"20240122165750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"侧柏油——外用治诸癣痈毒，游丹秃疮，头面耳部黄水疮，杀虫虱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165749-tjjkcyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165749-tjjkcyn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"侧柏根皮——主凉血，生毛发，治火灼烂疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165751-4qbq35s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165751-4qbq35s"}},{"ID":"20240122165755-ntu3a87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165755-ntu3a87"}},{"ID":"20240122165755-9bf8r4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165755-9bf8r4g","updated":"20240204161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第九这个大家看一下，我们刚刚，回头一下这个赤小豆这个艾叶看看，我都忘了给大家看看，赤小豆看起来像红豆，艾叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165756-pkvy373","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165756-pkvy373","updated":"20240204161548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第九柏叶，这个柏叶诸位看看这个柏叶，就是柏树的叶子，那经方里面吐血不止，这个吐血里面的原因可能是肝癌肝硬化的病人，肝病很严重肝会压迫到食道旁边的门静脉破裂以后吐血出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165806-68rtwwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165806-68rtwwn","updated":"20240204161617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我不管里面的原因是什么，病人吐血就可以使用柏叶，那这个柏叶呢我们一般侧生的柏叶入药，所以都是使用侧柏叶，侧柏叶呢味是苦涩一点点寒药味是苦涩，那柏叶呢是滋阴凉血的药，主吐血鼻血小便带血都可以使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165810-8sl365x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165810-8sl365x","updated":"20240204161703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们这个，因为柏叶它能够补血，是侧生的我们取它侧生的，我们把柏叶跟当归混在一起的时候就变成很有名的生发的药，所以头发要长就当归和侧柏叶两个混在一起，当归是补血的，侧柏叶呢是侧生嘛，那你原来的发根那个根那个洞掉了对不对，我们让它长出旁边旁边再长出一根来，要侧柏叶，所以我们补血的药里面，头发药长头发药，我们就会使用这个药，那这是血剂，这个滋阴凉血的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165819-3aw1sy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165819-3aw1sy4","updated":"20240204161856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看那个【大明】有没有，他说专门灸制以后冻疮，烧，烧取汁涂头那个柏叶的汁涂到头发里也可以，那这个其他的侧柏叶枝啊侧柏叶油啊侧柏叶根皮诸位自己看一下就可以了。"}]}]}